    schema:title "Java Software Engineer (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/intus-workforce-solutions-bv/java-software-engineer-berlin-468196> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-junior-campaign-manager-hamburg-102836> a prov:Entity,
