    schema:description "We are looking for a UK Nominee Director to fulfil a formal company appointment and assist with basic compliance requirements. This is a part-time, non-operational position with minimal involvement. The initial setup may take approximately 1–2 hours, with occasional tasks required throughout the year. Key Responsibilities: Hold the appointed UK Nominee Director position. Sign company and bank account documentation remotely when required. Assist with occasional corporate compliance matters. Compensation: £100 - £125 per month. What We Offer: Flexible remote part-time opportunity Very limited ongoing involvement No day-to-day business responsibilities Requirements: Must be a permanent UK resident. Comfortable using email, online communication tools and other digital systems. Able to complete occasional administrative tasks remotely. Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
