            schema:name "Köln" ] ;
    schema:title "Senior Controller (all genders)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/armedangels/senior-controller-all-genders-koln-369342> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-controller-leutenberg-2437> a prov:Entity,
