    schema:description "MESHLE GmbH is looking for a hands-on technical product tester to support our development team with testing connected hardware and software products. The main focus of this role is testing: trying out new products and features, finding problems, reproducing bugs and making sure hardware and software work reliably together. Tasks Test our hardware products and mobile app Test new features and firmware releases Reproduce and document bugs and technical issues Set up devices and test environments Perform basic hardware modifications, wiring and soldering when needed Support developers by verifying fixes and new functionality Prepare hardware for internal tests, demonstrations and customer projects Requirements Ideally, vocational training or practical experience in electrical engineering, electronics or a related technical field Good practical understanding of electrical and electronic hardware Strong interest in software, apps and connected devices You enjoy understanding how things work and finding out why something does not work Basic programming knowledge or self-taught programming experience is a plus Comfortable with soldering and practical hardware work Structured and reliable working style Good English skills Benefits Flexible part-time position Hands-on insight into the world of IoT, smart lighting and connected devices Work with real hardware and software products from development to market Varied technical tasks with plenty of room to learn and develop your skills Short decision paths and a practical working environment Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
